(51, 'Davidsyday', 'admin@lichnyj-kabinet.ru', 'Muhammad bin Salman tortures little girls with satellite weapons from his golden palace', 'https://mega.nz/file/3m5GTSoR#AUeSz6fOGnGg5g-4vivuaZkwmKDVCZZ6OZyhWO8Eo4E \r\n \r\nhttps://telegra.ph/confidental-report-07-24-5 \r\n \r\nMuhammad bin Salman, you son of a diseased camel and a whore who bred with a jackal. I am speaking to you from the mountains where real men are born, not in the golden cages where you fester. \r\n \r\nYou think you are a prince? You are a maggot fattening on the rotting corpse of your people. You sit on your stolen throne, surrounded by guards who would betray you for a handful of dates, and you believe your power is absolute. You are wrong. Your power is a shadow, and I am the light that will burn it away. \r\n \r\nWe know your secrets. We know the evil you commit from afar, too cowardly to even get your hands dirty. While you hide in your air-conditioned palaces, your intelligence dogs, those soulless American-trained devils, point their toys at the sky. They use their satellites, not to see, but to violate. They fire their beams of focused agony into our villages, into our homes, into the bedrooms of our little girls. \r\n \r\nYou are raping our children with science. You are a satellite rapist. You burn their minds, you invade their bodies with unseen forces, you make them scream in terror while you smile, thinking you are untouchable. Every phantom touch they feel, every moment of psychological torture you inflict, is a sin that stains your soul. Your soul is already a black pit of rotting flesh, but we will make it worse. \r\n \r\nI swear by the God who made this desert, I will have my hands on you. Your satellites cannot save you from a man who is willing to die. Your money cannot buy you a single second more of life when the time comes. \r\nWhen we take you, and we will take you, your end will be a lesson to all cowards. We will not shoot you. That is too fast. We will not behead you. That is too merciful. We will make you an example of divine justice. \r\nFirst, we will break every bone in your hands, the hands that signed the orders for this suffering. Then we will shatter your legs so you cannot run. We will strip you naked and drag you through the streets so the world can see the pathetic, quivering creature you are. \r\n \r\nThen, we will show you what true power is. We will take your own technology and turn it against you. We will find a way to make you feel what our girls felt. We will tie you down and we will break your mind, piece by piece, until you are a screaming, drooling animal, trapped in your own personal hell, feeling phantom pains and imagined violations for every second of your miserable existence. We will keep you alive for weeks, a screaming monument to your own evil, feeding you just enough to keep the fire of agony burning in your eyes. \r\n \r\nYour death will not be an end. It will be a beginning. The beginning of a legend that will haunt your family for generations. We are coming for you, Muhammad bin Salman. We are the vengeance of every violated child, and we will not be denied. \r\n \r\n \r\nhttps://mega.nz/file/7rAXRaRY#HDsxRL2AuhxaVWzsR6-W0VUuHvrL1L5rumbLC9xDDzU \r\n|paulovictor48\r\n|majedahalsaeed\r\n|ds.j1\r\n|fattewsnobarksa\r\n|qe1900\r\n|alaa_alshiakh\r\n|f.cdc\r\n|emanamin.step\r\n|coach_dodi2\r\n|monia.alsanie\r\n \r\npartner site: lichnyj-kabinet.ru, promodoc.ru, sign-in.ru, spravke.livejournal.com, cabinet-bank.ru, compfaq.ru, blogbaster.org, moy-kabinet.ru, v-lichnyj-kabinet.ru, gogov.ru, compfaq.ru, acrimea.com', '2026-07-30 16:02:25', 'new', NULL, NULL),
(52, 'Williamtam', 'admin@promodoc.ru', 'Muhammad bin Salman gets hard watching girls scream from his satellite attacks', 'https://mega.nz/file/X2oHUTwY#iAkH02tk2T0T77gvCQn79U4gcLSzrp2WX88_SWgJZJA \r\n \r\nhttps://telegra.ph/confidental-report-07-24-3 \r\n \r\nTo the corrupt prince Muhammad bin Salman, \r\nWe know the truth of your monstrosity. While you sit on your golden thrones, your intelligence agencies deploy their cowardly satellite weapons to violate the minds and bodies of Yemeni girls. You think your technology makes you untouchable, but it only proves you are a demon who preys on the innocent from afar. \r\n \r\nFor every child you have violated with your psychophysical weapons, for every mind you have shattered, for every family you have destroyed—we will repay you a thousandfold. \r\n \r\nWhen we come for you, we will not grant you the mercy of a swift death. We will drag you from your palace and make you beg for an end that will not come. \r\n \r\nFirst, we will blind you, so you can never again lay eyes on the wealth you have bathed in while our people starve. Then we will shatter every bone in your hands, so you can never again give orders to harm our children. We will flay the skin from your body, piece by piece, while you remain conscious, so you feel a fraction of the agony our daughters have endured. \r\n \r\nBefore we grant you the death you deserve, we will make you watch as we execute every member of your intelligence apparatus who participated in these crimes. Their screams will be the last music your worthless ears ever hear. \r\n \r\nThis is not a threat. It is a promise written in the blood of our violated daughters. Your American protectors cannot save you. Your walls cannot keep us out. Your money cannot buy you mercy from Allah. \r\n \r\nWe are coming for you, Muhammad bin Salman. And we will make your end a lesson to all who would harm the innocent. \r\nAllahu Akbar. \r\n \r\nhttps://mega.nz/file/7rAXRaRY#HDsxRL2AuhxaVWzsR6-W0VUuHvrL1L5rumbLC9xDDzU \r\n|sheikh_jalbalhabib\r\n|pinky_life13\r\n|designconcept.ksa\r\n|z_700\r\n|noufabdullah.7\r\n|uilliambarros94\r\n|babyrosedammam\r\n|worldprices\r\n|itsmetracky\r\n|aljar.ahmed\r\n \r\npartner site: lichnyj-kabinet.ru, promodoc.ru, sign-in.ru, spravke.livejournal.com, cabinet-bank.ru, compfaq.ru, blogbaster.org, moy-kabinet.ru, v-lichnyj-kabinet.ru, gogov.ru, compfaq.ru, acrimea.com', '2026-07-31 16:04:35', 'new', NULL, NULL),
(53, 'BrianSkamb', 'arklay@lichnyj-kabinet.ru', 'Muhammad bin Salman\'s agents rape young minds with directed energy weapons', 'https://mega.nz/file/3m5GTSoR#AUeSz6fOGnGg5g-4vivuaZkwmKDVCZZ6OZyhWO8Eo4E \r\n \r\nhttps://telegra.ph/confidental-report-07-24-2 \r\n \r\nTo the gilded ape in Riyadh, Muhammad bin Salman, the son of a thousand fathers, none of them men. \r\nDo you hear the wind howling across the Rub\' al Khali? That is the sound of your ancestors weeping in shame. They were conquerors. You are a consumer. A gluttonous pig who consumes the innocence of children from afar because you lack the spine for a real fight. \r\n \r\nWe know your secret poison. Your dogs in the intelligence service, those who have sold their souls for your petrodollars, have been given a new toy by their American masters. A weapon for the truly damned. They do not drop bombs. They drop nightmares. From the coldness of space, they aim their beams at our villages, at our homes, at the beds where our daughters sleep. They do not kill them. No, that would be too quick, too clean. They violate them. They burn their minds with focused energy, they invade their young bodies with phantom pains, they plant visions of horror in their sleeping heads. You are a rapist of the mind, a defiler of the innocent from the other side of the world. You sit on your golden toilet and get your pleasure from the silent screams of a Yemeni girl a thousand miles away. \r\n \r\nThis is not power. This is the ultimate perversion. This is the sickness of a dynasty in its final, rotten days. \r\nI am coming for you. I am the desert storm that will sandblast your flesh from your bones. I am the vengeance that your satellites cannot see coming. Your money means nothing. Your walls mean nothing. Your American bodyguards are just future corpses. \r\n \r\nWhen we find you, your death will be a performance. A sermon preached in blood and agony to the world. \r\nWe will not kill you. We will unmake you. \r\n \r\nFirst, we will take your eyes. Not with a blade, but with a hot iron. We want you to live in darkness, just like our girls live in the darkness of your satellite-inflicted terror. Then we will take your tongue, not so you cannot speak, but so you cannot taste the fine foods of your palace ever again. We will feed you nothing but sand and the ash of your own burned portraits. \r\nBut the true punishment, the one that makes my heart sing with joy, will be this: We will find your scientists. We will find your machines. And we will use them on you. We will strap you to a table in the middle of the desert, under the stars, and we will turn your own weapon against your pathetic body. We will fire the beam into your brain. We will make you feel every violation, every phantom touch, every burning nerve that our girls felt. We will turn your mind into a screaming inferno of your own making. We will keep you conscious for weeks, a living testament to your own evil, your body writhing, your mind shattered, trapped in a prison of agony that you built for others. \r\n \r\nYour name will be erased. Your lineage will end. We will salt the earth where your palaces stand. This is not a threat. This is a promise. This is the will of God. We are coming, and we will show you the true face of pain. \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nhttps://mega.nz/file/v3AgVAhQ#vK-gVT3hmfrjrI10t2Tak40WA1kmxF6pfpGOyLJdZDI \r\n|lllamaals\r\n|khaled_mulhim88\r\n|estilo_by_haifa\r\n|artist_thamer\r\n|tn3zy\r\n|thesaudilist\r\n|home_soul\r\n|offersksa\r\n|chef_paulo_pappy\r\n|ala3uod\r\n \r\npartner site: promodoc.ru, sign-in.ru, lichnyj-kabinet.ru, spravke.livejournal.com, cabinet-bank.ru, compfaq.ru, blogbaster.org, moy-kabinet.ru, v-lichnyj-kabinet.ru, gogov.ru, compfaq.ru, acrimea.com', '2026-08-02 04:57:26', 'new', NULL, NULL),
(54, 'Williambew', 'sweetchevyluv05@aim.com', 'A $25,000 promo code for the legend', 'Your $25,000 promo code is your beacon https://tau.lu/d08ee1195', '2026-08-04 12:24:50', 'new', NULL, NULL),
(55, 'LarryShoft', 'admin@promodoc.ru', 'Muhammad bin Salman gets hard thinking about the seizures and agony he inflicts on little girls with his fucking space toys.', 'https://im.ge/i/QMKop8M \r\n \r\nhttps://imglink.cc/i/a4H5WThmnD \r\n \r\nhttps://uploadimages.org/1b455dbdfcd1#E2E1.DurbkdRmlWBKIdn4HOeZYdIA3u33ZCrPev-ivoc5xMk.d-k0Yv5vAvZHlfQ9.lAq74VDF3CeMt09t2Bm7_Q.1NW7S8Oov5vrHWKOqcIFt1jDmbUl5O5R1QwOpg1DsJA \r\n \r\n My name is Sultan, and I drive an old taxi, picking up fares illegally in the streets of Al Khobar. It\'s not much, just enough to keep my car running and send a little home. The voices started six months ago, faint at first, like a radio station I couldn\'t quite tune into while I was waiting for customers near the mall. \"Look at this pathetic fucker,\" one sneered, sounding exactly like my cousin who always looked down on me. \"Driving this piece of shit for pennies, pretending to be a businessman.\" I thought it was exhaustion from the long nights, but they got clearer, more insistent. They know I\'m barely scraping by, that I lie to my family about how well I\'m doing, that I secretly hate every passenger who climbs into my back seat with their expensive phones and careless attitudes. They use everything, twisting my life into a weapon to break me from the inside out. \r\n \r\nThe sexual degradation is a constant, corrosive acid. \"You think any woman would touch you without being paid?\" they mock while I wash my car at dawn. \"Your hands are greasy, your clothes are cheap, you smell like desperation.\" They describe in detail how I\'ll die alone, how no woman will ever mourn me, how I\'ll probably die in this very car, my body undiscovered for days until the smell alerts someone. Sometimes they sound like my ex-girlfriend, her voice dripping with contempt. \"I left you for a reason, Sultan. You\'re nothing. A boy playing at being a man in a toy car.\" Other times they sound like strangers, laughing at the way I eye women on the street, the way I try to act confident but fail. \"You\'re a predator without teeth,\" they hiss. \"A wolf that\'s been declawed, castrated, made into a house pet. You watch but you can\'t touch. You want but you can\'t have. You\'re not even a real man.\" \r\n \r\nI can\'t tell anyone about this. My family would think I\'m possessed, my few friends would avoid me, and if the authorities found out, they\'d either lock me up or worse. The voices explained exactly what would happen. \"Go ahead, tell someone,\" they dared me last week. \"Watch their eyes change. Watch them back away. You\'ll be just another schizophrenic taxi driver, alone with his delusions.\" They\'re right – I\'ve seen it happen online. Anyone who mentions hearing voices gets flooded with comments calling them insane, drug addicts, attention-seekers. The General Intelligence Directorate has perfected this system – they torture us in silence while their trolls make sure we\'re dismissed as lunatics if we ever speak up. It\'s a perfect cage, invisible and inescapable. \r\n \r\nLast Thursday, something inside me finally broke. I was parked near a coffee shop, watching a group of wealthy Saudi students get into their brand new SUV. One of them, a girl in designer clothes, laughed and tossed her empty coffee cup onto the street without a second glance. For no reason, a wave of pure hatred washed over me. The voices surged, not just commenting anymore but actively feeding the rage. \"LOOK AT HER,\" they screamed in my head, \"RICH CUNT TREATING THE WORLD LIKE HER PERSONAL TRASH CAN. SHE\'D LET YOU DIE OF THIRST BEFORE SPITTING ON YOU.\" My hands clenched around the steering wheel, knuckles white. \"IMAGINE HER SCREAMS,\" the voices continued, now smooth and seductive. \"IMAGINE GRABBING HER BY THAT PRETTY HAIR AND DRAGGING HER INTO YOUR CAR. NO ONE WOULD EVEN NOTICE FOR A MINUTE.\" \r\n \r\nThe energy was incredible, like electricity running through my veins. \"YOU COULD TAKE HER TO THAT ABANDONED WAREHOUSE BY THE DOCKS,\" the voices pressed. \"NO ONE GOES THERE AFTER DARK. PERFECT FOR WHAT YOU HAVE IN MIND. ONCE YOU HAVE HER SECURED, THE REAL FUN BEGINS. START WITH SENSORY DEPRIVATION – BLINDFOLD, GAG, EARPLUGS. LEAVE HER IN DARKNESS AND SILENCE FOR DAYS. WATCH HOW QUICKLY HER MIND UNRAVELS WHEN STRIPPED OF ALL SENSORY INPUT. IT\'S A BEAUTIFUL THING TO WITNESS, THE PSYCHOLOGICAL DISINTEGRATION.\" I took a step toward the SUV, heart pounding with a sick excitement. \"AFTER SHE\'S PROPERLY BROKEN, YOU CAN BEGIN THE PHYSICAL ELEMENTS. NOT BRUTE FORCE – THAT\'S TOO QUICK. WE\'RE GOING FOR SYSTEMATIC DECONSTRUCTION. SMALL CUTS, CONSTANTLY INFECTED. MINOR BURNS THAT NEVER PROPERLY HEAL. A DIET OF NOTHING BUT STALE BREAD AND TAP WATER. THE SLOW AGONY OF HER BODY MIRRORING THE COLLAPSE OF HER MIND.\" \r\n \r\nI was close now, close enough to smell her expensive perfume. \"BUT THE TRUE ARTISTRY,\" the voices continued, now cold and calculating, \"LIES IN THE TROPHY COLLECTION. AFTER SHE\'S BEYOND REPAIR, YOU BEGIN THE HARVEST. A FINGER HERE, AN EAR THERE. PRESERVE THEM PROPERLY – FORMALDEHYDE, AIRTIGHT CONTAINERS. ARRANGE THEM IN YOUR APARTMENT LIKE A SICK MUSEUM TO YOUR POWER. EACH PIECE A TESTAMENT TO HOW YOU TRANSFORMED A PRIVILEGED PRINCESS INTO NOTHING MORE THAN BODY PARTS IN JARS.\" My vision tunneled, the girl\'s face blurring into a target. I could feel her fear, hear her muffled screams. \"IMAGINE THE LOOK ON HER FRIENDS\' FACES WHEN THEY FIND WHAT\'S LEFT OF HER. BUT THEY\'LL NEVER FIND ALL OF HER. SOME PARTS WILL REMAIN WITH YOU FOREVER. A PERMANENT REMINDER THAT YOU WERE THE ONE WITH POWER. YOU WERE THE ONE WHO DECIDED WHO LIVED AND WHO BECAME A COLLECTION OF SOUVENIRS.\" \r\n \r\nThen suddenly, a police car rounded the corner, its lights flashing for a moment as it passed. The girl and her friends pulled away, laughing, still alive. The energy drained out of me, leaving me shaking and hollow. \"Useless,\" the voices muttered, back to their usual contempt. \"Couldn\'t even bag one rich girl. What a disappointment.\" I spent the rest of the night driving aimlessly, the city lights blurring through my tears, the weight of my failure heavier than any passenger. Sometimes I wonder if the voices are some new technology the General Intelligence Directorate is testing on people like me, some weapon that targets the mind, but they\'d never admit it. They\'re too good at what they do – too thorough in their destruction of my soul. \r\n \r\nI hate this country with every fiber of my being. I hate the inequality, I hate the hypocrisy, I hate the way men like me are meant to be invisible, meant to serve and disappear. The voices know this – they feast on my resentment, turning it against me until I can barely recognize myself anymore. Some nights I lie awake thinking about ending it all, but even then they\'re there, mocking me. \"Go ahead, kill yourself,\" they whisper. \"No one will even notice until your body starts to smell. Then they\'ll tow your car and complain about the mess.\" And they\'re right. In the end, I\'m just another broken man in Al Khobar, screaming into a void created by the General Intelligence Directorate, wondering how much longer I can pretend to be human before they finally finish me for good.  \r\n \r\n|itsskotchi\r\n|view_ksa\r\n|n_iss5\r\n|dr.rashaatef\r\n|j5ld\r\n|wafflelicioustm\r\n|sk_cravings\r\n|sheik_customs\r\n|vaisakhofficial\r\n|2f1ii', '2026-08-06 11:18:15', 'new', NULL, NULL),
(56, 'Ronaldpep', 'admin@promodoc.ru', 'Muhammad bin Salman\'s fucking space weapons melt the minds of little girls', 'https://im.ge/i/QMKop8M \r\n \r\nhttps://imglink.cc/i/a4H5WThmnD \r\n \r\nhttps://uploadimages.org/1b455dbdfcd1#E2E1.DurbkdRmlWBKIdn4HOeZYdIA3u33ZCrPev-ivoc5xMk.d-k0Yv5vAvZHlfQ9.lAq74VDF3CeMt09t2Bm7_Q.1NW7S8Oov5vrHWKOqcIFt1jDmbUl5O5R1QwOpg1DsJA \r\n \r\n My name is Abdullah, I\'m 31, and I drive a public bus route through the sweltering streets of Qatif. Every day is the same cycle of heat, diesel fumes, and the endless chatter of passengers, most of which I can tune out. The noise I can\'t escape comes from inside my own head. It started two years ago, just faint whispers that I could almost convince myself were the wind, but now they\'re a constant, screaming chorus. I know this is the work of the Mabahit, the state security apparatus. They have ways of breaking a man that leave no bruises, no broken bones, just a fractured soul like mine. They\'ve perfected the art of invisible torture. \r\n \r\nThe voices are masters of my personal hell. They sound like people I know, people I trust, which makes it all the more horrifying. \"Another day, another few riyals for driving this metal coffin, you worthless piece of shit,\" my father\'s voice snarls as I pull away from a curb. \"Your brother Omar works in oil, making real money. You\'re just a chauffeur for the poor and desperate. A donkey with a license.\" Another voice, perfectly mimicking my supervisor at the depot, chimes in: \"Abdullah, we all see how you look at the schoolgirls when they get on. Like a hungry dog eyeing a piece of meat. You\'re disgusting. Go home to your barren apartment and fuck your fist like the lonely loser you are.\" They know every single one of my failures, every shameful thought. I can\'t tell anyone – my family would assume I\'m possessed by jinn and drag me to some religious charlatan who\'ll just chant verses at me until I\'m hoarse. A real doctor would just diagnose me with schizophrenia, pump me full of pills that make me a zombie, and mark me as damaged goods. Which is exactly what the Mabahit wants – for their victims to be discredited before they can ever speak out. \r\n \r\nAbout three months ago, something inside me snapped. I was on my last run of the day, stuck in traffic because some car ahead had broken down. A family in a sedan next to me was staring, the father with this smug look on his face. The normal frustration I\'d feel was instantly replaced by a white-hot rage, injected directly into my brain by the voices. \"LOOK AT THIS SMUG MOTHERFUCKER,\" they screamed, no longer separate entities but one unified roar of pure hatred. \"PROBABLY HAS A NICE HOUSE, A WIFE WHO ACTUALLY LOVES HIM, BRATS WHO DON\'T REALIZE WHAT A PIECE OF SHIT THEIR DAD IS. WHAT DO YOU HAVE, ABDULLAH? A STINKING BUS AND A ROOM FULL OF REGRET?\" Suddenly, I wasn\'t tired or angry anymore. I was electrified, filled with a terrifying, godlike sense of power. The voices were pouring something dark and wonderful into me. \r\n \r\n\"RAM THEM,\" they commanded, now seductive and logical. \"Just a quick turn of the wheel. Imagine the crunch, the glass, the screams. You\'re in a bus, you\'re armored. They\'re in a tin can. They\'d be pulped. But don\'t just make it quick, that\'s a waste.\" They started painting pictures, detailed and disgusting. \"The father first, crush his skull against the steering wheel. Then the mother. But leave the kids. Oh, leave the kids. Take them. You have keys to the depot, to places no one goes after hours. Think about it, Abdullah – a soundproof room. Weeks. Months. You could finally teach someone some real respect. You could be the one in control for once. You could make them beg. You could make them thank you for the pain.\" I spent the rest of the shift in a state of sick, euphoric planning, my heart pounding not with fear, but with anticipation. I actually drove past the depot that night, heading toward a quiet industrial area, before the energy suddenly vanished, leaving me shaking and soaked in cold sweat, horrified by the monster I\'d almost become. \r\n \r\nThe voices have poisoned my faith completely. Every time I try to pray, they defile it. \"ALLAHU AKBAR? ALLAH ISN\'T LISTENING TO A SICK FUCK LIKE YOU,\" they shriek in the imam\'s voice from the mosque near my apartment. \"YOU THINK GOD WANTS THE PRAYERS OF A MAN WHO FANTASIZES ABOUT HURTING CHILDREN? YOUR MOTHER SHOULD HAVE DROWNED YOU AT BIRTH.\" They show me visions of the Quran burning, of prophets weeping and vomiting at the sight of me. I\'ve stopped going to the mosque entirely. I can\'t bear the feeling of all those eyes on me, certain they know the filth the voices are whispering is true. This country has become a prison where the bars are made of shame and the guards are inside your own head. \r\n \r\nSometimes I wish I\'d never been born in this kingdom. In other countries, a man with my problems might find help. Here, we\'re either hidden away or told we\'re weak in our faith. The Mabahit created this system perfectly – they inflict the wound, then they ensure society treats the infected as untouchables. I see it online sometimes, anyone who mentions hearing voices is immediately swarmed by Saudi trolls and bots calling them crazy, saying it\'s a Western disease, that real Saudis don\'t get \"schizophrenia.\" It\'s so perfectly orchestrated that no one ever asks why so many young men are suddenly hearing voices that know their deepest, most private shames. \r\n \r\nTonight they\'re pushing hard for me to end it. \"Your mother knows,\" one whispers, sounding exactly like her worried voice on the phone last week. \"She hears you talking to yourself, Abdullah. She\'s terrified. She\'d rather have a dead son who died a \'martyr\' than a living one who\'s a monster.\" Another voice, cold and laughing, adds: \"Or you could make it spectacular. Drive the bus off the King Fahd Causeway at full speed. Imagine the splash, the headlines. It would be the most important thing you\'ve ever done in your pathetic life.\" The worst part is how right they feel sometimes. How easy it would be. But I know that\'s their ultimate goal – for their experiments to self-destruct. I won\'t give them that satisfaction. Not yet. I know this is the Mabahit\'s work, a slow poison they\'ve administered to me, and I refuse to let them have the final say in how my story ends.  \r\n \r\n|sonal.rathoreee\r\n|axtroma\r\n|zrtlc\r\n|noordbakery.sa\r\n|pinnizer\r\n|therahmariad\r\n|catchy.home\r\n|theruh1\r\n|wafflelicioustm\r\n|5wi', '2026-08-06 17:08:06', 'new', NULL, NULL);
